#!/bin/bash
# furfetch - SFW boykisser + mlm + furry fetch, 16+ safe, no NSFW
# Part of Furarcher Asahi Edition
# Usage: furfetch [boykisser|mlm|furry|femboy|gaylove|bear]

PINK='\033[38;5;212m'; PURPLE='\033[0;35m'; BLUE='\033[38;5;75m'; GOLD='\033[38;5;220m'
CYAN='\033[0;36m'; NC='\033[0m'

MOOD="${1:-boykisser}"
case "$MOOD" in --help|-h) echo "usage: furfetch [boykisser|mlm|furry|femboy|gaylove|bear|midnight]"; exit 0;; esac

echo -e "${PINK}"
case "$MOOD" in
  mlm|achillean)
    echo -e "${BLUE}"
    cat <<'FURART'
  /\  /\    /\  /\
 ( o_o  )  ( o_o  )   men loving men
  > :3 < ~~ > :3 <
 /|   |\/|   |\     holding paws, SFW
(_|   |_)(_|   |_)
   mlm • achillean • boyfriends
FURART
    ;;
  furry|paw|bear)
    cat <<'FURART'
   __    __   furry night walk
  ( o_o  )( o_o  )
  (  >^<  )(  >^<  )
  /| paw || paw |\
 (_|    |)(_|    |_)  howl softly, SFW
     furries • paws • bears
FURART
    ;;
  femboy)
    cat <<'FURART'
  /\  /\    ____
 ( o_o  )  / @@ \
  > :3 <  | (..) |  femboy mode
 /|striped|\ \ @@ /  thigh-high power
(_|   |_)  /___\    soft + strong, SFW
FURART
    ;;
  gaylove|honey|gay)
    echo -e "${GOLD}"
    cat <<'FURART'
   _  _    gay love is love
  ( \/ )   two paws + one heart
   \  /  _ ( o_o ) _
   \/  (_| > :3 < |_)  cheek kiss, SFW
        boyfriends forever
FURART
    ;;
  midnight|midnight-kiss)
    cat <<'FURART'
  /\  /\   . * :3 * .
 ( -_-  )  midnight kiss
  > :3 <   stars + pink glow
 /|   |\   sleepy boykisser, SFW
(_|   |_)
FURART
    ;;
  *) # boykisser default
    cat <<'FURART'
  /\  /\    ____
 ( o_o  )  / @@ \
  > :3 <  | (..) |  boykisser mode
 /|   |\   \ @@ /
(_|   |_)  /___\
  gay boys - furries - femboys - SFW
FURART
    ;;
esac
echo -e "${NC}"

echo -e "${PURPLE}furfetch${NC} -- SFW ${MOOD} mode ^_^"
echo "--------------------------------"
if command -v fastfetch >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  fastfetch --logo none 2>/dev/null | head -n 20
else
  echo "os: $(grep PRETTY_NAME /etc/os-release 2>/dev/null | cut -d= -f2 | tr -d '"')"
  echo "kernel: $(uname -r)"
  echo "arch: $(uname -m)"
  echo "shell: $SHELL"
  echo "de: ${XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP:-unknown}"
fi
# Asahi detect
if grep -qi asahi /proc/version 2>/dev/null || [ -f /etc/asahi-release ]; then
  echo -e "${CYAN}platform:${NC} Apple Silicon (Asahi Linux) :3"
else
  echo -e "${CYAN}platform:${NC} $(uname -m)"
fi
# GPU hint
if command -v glxinfo >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo -e "${CYAN}gpu:${NC} $(glxinfo 2>/dev/null | grep -i 'OpenGL renderer' | head -1)"
fi
echo -e "${PINK}stay soft, stay proud, stay SFW <3${NC}"
